  "goodToKnow": "Das Exemplar is a copy of a book, newspaper or magazine: Das Buch hat sich zwei Millionen Mal verkauft, two million Exemplare. It's a false friend: it doesn't mean exemplary (that's vorbildlich). A photocopy is eine Kopie. Das Exemplar is also a specimen: ein seltenes Exemplar, ein Prachtexemplar (a fine specimen, also said of people). Exemplarisch means as an example: exemplarisch zeigen."
